  "title": "Vertiv Announces Winners of North American Partner Program Awards",
  "summary": "Vertiv, formerly Emerson Network Power, announced the North American Partner Award winners for 2016 achievement at their annual Partner Summit in Nashville, TN. The award-winning companies were selected based on their commitment to empowering the vital applications of the digital world and supporting today’s growing mobile, cloud and edge computing markets with Vertiv IT infrastructure solutions.",
